          </p>

          <p>
            The math is the same one we use across the site: price divided by the number of 25 g portions of protein in the tub. Ten servings of 21 g is 210 g of protein, or 8.4 portions of 25 g, and $14.99 divided by 8.4 is about $1.78. For the collagen, 17 servings of 11 g is 187 g of protein, or 7.5 portions, so $7.99 works out to about $1.07 per 25 g before you account for it being an incomplete protein.
